 cuba so  nixon orders monroe killed and makes it  look like a suicide we also get this  image of an alien before munroe is taken  by the men in black i'm more inclined to  believe that this is a figment of her  imagination and not an actual alien a  year later president lyndon johnson is  brought to area 51. it's assumed he's  president here after taking the role  soon after kennedy's assassination here  we see way more of those fetus tanks  just like we saw in the basement of the  white house so it looks like all the  presidents after dwight up until present  day have been in on this conspiracy back  in what we believe to be present day  troy is ready to give birth you'll  notice the location here looks oddly  similar to that of the cooperatives in  season 8 apocalypse is the cooperative  actually behind this or did production  simply want to reuse a location theta is  overlooking troy's progress and we do  get confirmation of not only her  telepathic abilities but the ability to  ease one's pain her powers reminded me a  bit like a jedis and troy will need this  pain suppressed especially considering  the baby about to be ripped from his  stomach these alien hybrid babies are  contained in sacks and killed  immediately if they aren't up to snuff  it makes me question why theta was  spared she seems to be a hybrid judging  by her half human half alien eyes a tank  is brought up where the dead baby is  stored and all i can think about are how  these hybrids have a connection to water  cow's baby who we see at the end has  these octopus-like tentacles tentacles  are shown throughout the introductory  credits and with ryan murphy talking  about sirens being a theme something is  definitely going on here troy is brought  back to the group a week later  traumatized by the events he just  endured he tells cal who himself is  close to giving birth that they'll need  to find a way to escape but calico has  to rain on their parade and tells them  there's no way out she imp